generalComment:
The process "boric oxide, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  boric oxide from boric acid in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation, Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
